How do QR codes handle errata? Is the QR merly a link to a centralised hub that stores all the info on it, thus text on cards might not match up with what the app says happens?

[/quote]

Your phone will shoot a laser that will burn the errata&#39;ed card and automatically order you a replacement.&nbsp;

